        <** @description: This value will change every time the telemetry is requested. When sending the telecommand to set the option bytes, this parameter must be set to the last value returned by the telemetry request. If this parameter is not correct the telecommand will return a Sequence error Nack. This scheme is implemented to ensure that the user obtains the current option bytes, and only modify what is required, before setting **>
